        "@value": "Includes: announcement (1 p.); general press release concerning the competition and prizes (3 pp.); \"First Prizewinner\" (2 pp.); \"Second Prize\u2022 winner (2 pp.); \"Second Prizewinner (1 p.); \"Press Conference\" (1 p.); \"Experiments in Art and Technology: A Brief History\" (2 pp.); \"E. A. T. Facts and Activities\" (2 pp.); \"The Museum of Modem Art Publishes\" (1 p.);"
      },
      {
        "@value": "\"Advance Information on 'The Machine as Seen at the End of the Mechanical Age' \" (1 p. ); \"Fact Sheet ' Some More Beginnings' E. A. T. Exhibition at the Brooklyn Museum\" (1 p.); \"The Machine: Special Programs and Lecture Series\" (1 p.); information sheet on evening programs (2 pp.); postcard of computer processed image, \"Nude\" by Leon Harmon and Ken Knowlton (2pp.);"
      },
